elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">B站发布2026年Q1财报：实现扭亏为盈，AI驱动广告收入激增30%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱发布GLM-5.1高速版API，实现400 tokens/s输出速度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，智谱正式面向企业客户上线GLM-5.1高速版API（GLM-5.1-highspeed）。该模型在保持旗舰级基座能力的同时，实测输出速度达到400 tokens/s，刷新全球大模型官方API速度上限。产品支持200K超长上下文窗口，最大单次输出达128K标记。技术层面，智谱GLM团队与TileRT团队通过重写推理路径、优化动态批处理与KV Cache调度，以及硬件级集群协同，实现了“旗舰能力”与“极致低延迟”的并存。目前，该模型已通过智谱MaaS平台向特定企业客户定向开放。此举旨在解决Coding Agent、实时交互、多智能体并行推演等高频场景下的延迟瓶颈，助力企业在部署复杂系统时无需在模型智能度与响应速度间进行妥协，加速软件生态向智能体化迭代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">UCSD研究证实GPT-4.5通过图灵测试，胜率超真人且具备完美伪装能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/69056aa44007a63af553be961b3a49ab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校（UCSD）在《美国国家科学院院刊》（PNAS）发表研究，证实现代大语言模型已能通过经典三方图灵测试。在双盲实验中，GPT-4.5在特定人格提示下被判定为人类的胜率达73%，超越真人志愿者；开源模型LLaMa-3.1-405B胜率达56%，与人类表现持平。研究发现，AI胜出的关键在于学会了模拟人类的幽默感、直接性及“犯错”倾向，而非单纯比拼逻辑智商。若失去人格提示，GPT-4.5胜率降至36%。研究者指出，AI已成为完美的“说谎者”，这标志着图灵测试从衡量智能转向衡量“像人程度”。该成果引发行业对网络信任链条断裂的担忧，专家警告，AI在社交与客服场景的完美伪装极易被恶意利用，未来必须加速部署更严苛的数字身份验证与AI内容防伪机制，以应对日益严峻的社会风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29f544e819c801a31e134d098bfbc4a8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，OpenAI 正式推出 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件（Beta版），该插件已嵌入 PowerPoint 底层架构，面向全球所有 ChatGPT 用户（含免费版）开放。该工具旨在通过“对话即动作”的模式重塑办公流，核心功能包括：一句话自动生成包含大纲与布局的 PPT 初稿；针对现有页面进行文案润色与配色调整；以及主动识别内容逻辑缺口（Content Gaps）并预判汇报提问。为确保安全性，插件引入了“人在回路（Human-in-the-loop）”机制，对结构大改等关键操作强制执行人工确认。此次原生接入标志着 PPT 制作从“手动绘图”转向“智能体协作”，用户无需再进行繁琐的复制粘贴，直接在插件商店搜索安装即可使用，显著提升了职场办公的生产力效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Comscore发布2026年3月美国桌面端消费级AI聊天机器人市场报告，全美AI平台独立用户达4440万，环比增长超21%。OpenAI旗下ChatGPT以3386万独立访客稳居榜首，环比增长18.9%。谷歌Gemini以1066万访客位列第二，环比增长29.1%；微软Copilot以502万访客位居第三，环比增长44.4%。Anthropic旗下Claude表现最为亮眼，以266万独立访客位列第四，环比增速高达130.1%，成为市场最强劲的挑战者。榜单后续排名依次为X Grok（165万）、DeepSeek（41万）及Perplexity（36万）。数据表明，尽管头部产品优势明显，但后方梯队正以高增速快速渗透市场，桌面端AI竞争格局正趋于多元化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">B站发布2026年Q1财报：实现扭亏为盈，AI驱动广告收入激增30%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0719dd169958cbdcab8edffc93903fb7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">B站发布2026年第一季度财报，总营收达74.7亿元，同比增长7%，净利润实现2.02亿元，正式扭亏为盈。本季度广告业务表现强劲，收入达25.9亿元，同比激增30%，AI技术成为核心驱动力。目前，B站自动广告消耗渗透率已达85%，AI算法显著提升了广告投放转化效率及内容推荐精准度，助力用户日均使用时长创下119分钟的历史新高。在内容生态方面，AI相关内容观看时长环比增长44%。尽管游戏业务受高基数影响同比下滑12%，但公司明确了长线运营战略，并计划年内上线《三国志：王道天下》等新品。面对资本市场对AI基建投入的关注，管理层表示将持续加大投入以获取长期增长。此次财报标志着B站正式进入以技术驱动增长、社区价值变现的新盈利周期，转型为“视频社区+AI应用工厂”。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
